{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52813","headline":"秋夜泊江[渚]（诸） 二 · 李邕","name":"秋夜泊江[渚]（诸） 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"我有方寸心，安在六尺躯。\n怀山复怀□，□□□□□。\n水能澄不浑，剑用持复酬。\n珠已含报恩，□□□□□。\n□□贫与富，但愿一相知。\n（以上二首见伯三六一九卷）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李邕","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52813.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52813","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}